    "opening": "Orderly cup action and unanswered attention establish emotional distance. Different offers, withdrawal, pacing and imagined mornings earn the quiet rhythm; no new full-film pacing blocker observed.",
    "worlds": "Blue present stays unavailable; explicitly bounded gold futures are wished-for ordinary life. Amber/green private summer is remembered joy, not current recovery.",
    "memory": "C15\u201317 provide19.625s of shared-earbud, private exuberance. Her playful singing/laughter is with him, not a band performance. OriginalC16 style exception is visible and retained deliberately.",
    "climax": "Recognition and her broader closed-eye smile precede four fearful, tearful pleas. Full-force first plea and changing attacks/releases remain continuous in meaning; narrower preparatory mouths are not treated as neutral rest. No exact phoneme claim.",
    "ending": "C35 own clasp to chest/lap reads inward self-composure. C38 own cup movement and C39 own sip, brief tired mutual gaze, then downward tail provide fragile self-directed contact. No smile, hug, clinic, rescue or instant cure resolves the crisis. Actual departures from early draft retained explicitly underJML039\u2013041.",
    "context_dependency": "C28 broader smile is accepted as private finality only in this worried-man/immediate-plea/unresolved-aftermath sequence. Do not reuse isolated as proof of recovery."
